      "content": "i get what you're saying but i really cant deal with my doctor right now, everything is so expensive and i dont have time for an appointment just to ask about a sleep aid. if i just take a half dose of benadryl with my usual vicodin dose, it should be fine right? it's not like i'm taking a whole bottle. i just need to be able to sleep tonight so i can function tomorrow.",
